        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;PtpConfigs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• test-grandmaster — worker2, ens3f0&lt;br&gt;• test-bc-master1 — worker, ens1f0 (masterOnly 0) + ens1f1 (masterOnly 1), boundary_clock_jbod 1, phc2sys&lt;br&gt;• test-slave1 — worker3, ens5f0&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A single ptp4l instance on the BC node bridges both ports: it syncs on the slave port and serves time on the master port." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="770" y="100" width="310" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
