        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;PtpConfigs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• test-grandmaster — worker2, ens3f0 + ens3f1 (2 ports, same NIC = one PHC)&lt;br&gt;• test-bc-master1 — worker nic1 (phc2sys active)&lt;br&gt;• test-bc-master2 — worker nic2 (standby: no phc2sys)&lt;br&gt;• test-slave1 / test-slave2 — worker3&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The GM needs 2 ports: each BC slave port receives time over its own direct link, so BC2's PHC stays locked to the GM even though it never updates the OS clock." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="770" y="100" width="310" height="380" as="geometry" />
