        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;PtpConfigs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• test-grandmaster — worker2, ens3f0 + ens3f1&lt;br&gt;• test-bc-master1 — worker nic1 (ptp4l only)&lt;br&gt;• test-bc-master2 — worker nic2 (ptp4l only)&lt;br&gt;• HA profile — phc2sys only, haProfiles = bc1, bc2 profiles&lt;br&gt;• test-slave1 / test-slave2 — worker3&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;When BC1's slave link (L1) fails, phc2sys switches to BC2's PHC as the OS-clock source, and BC2's PHC also disciplines BC1's PHC while its slave interface is down." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
